== Walkthrough ==

[[Hemia Skemner]] is located on the top floor of the Academy of Arcane Science.

You say, 'Hail, Hemia Skemner'

: Hemia Skemner says 'How are you?  Welcome to the Academy of Arcane Science.  Please feel free to roam.  May knowledge be your goal.  Be you a [fellow scientist] or visitor, I am sure you will find whatever you seek.'

You say, 'I am a fellow scientist.'

: Hemia Skemner says 'That is good.  I hope you can handle the knowledge of arcane science.  Some have gone mad conducting research.  Such a person is [Lydl Mastat].'

You say, 'Who is Lydl Mastat?'

: Hemia Skemner says 'Lydl Mastat is nothing more than a young apprentice of mine.  He went mad working on a formula for deep water breathing.  He now roams the outskirts of Freeport boasting of power he does not have.  Someone should [teach Lydl a lesson].'

You say, 'I will teach Lydl a lesson.'

: Hemia Skemner says 'Then go.  He appears near the gates of Freeport from time to time.  He is not powerful, but he has a secret.  Nothing save magic can harm him.  This was the result of an experimental potion he drank.  Slay him and return his locked spellbook to me.'

[[Lydl Mastat]] can sometimes be found outside the gate in East Freeport near a couple of cacti, he may also be an NPC titled [[Lydl the Great]], located at -770, -1190.  He is level 4 and is invulnerable to non-magic weapons, so he needs to be killed with magic. 

: Lydl the Great says, 'Death to you all! Swords cannot harm a mighty follower of Innoruuk!'

Killing Lydl Mastat results in these faction adjustments:

<div class='facblock'>
* Your faction with [[Dismal Rage]] got worse. (-5)
* Your faction with [[Knights of Truth]] got better. (+5)
* Your faction with [[Opal Darkbriar]] got worse. (-1)
</div>

Loot [[Locked Book]].

You receive these faction adjustments when returning the book:

<div class='facblock'>
* Your faction with [[Arcane Scientists]] got better.
* Your faction with [[Knights of Truth]] got better.
* Your faction with [[Opal Darkbriar]] got worse.
* Your faction with [[The Freeport Militia]] got worse.
</div>
{{exp}}

Around 4% xp at level 3

